Daily Spend Tracker:

About the Project:
Daily Spend Tracker is an Android application designed to help users record and
manage their daily expenses. The application provides a simple way to keep track
of spending and organize expenses into different categories.

Features:
Record daily expenses
Categorize expenses
Track spending
Manage daily financial records
Simple and user-friendly interface
Google Sheets synchronization

Technologies Used:
Android Development
Google Sheets
Kotlin

What I Learned:
This project helped me understand how an application can be designed to solve an
everyday problem. I learned more about handling user data, organizing information,
creating useful application features, and connecting an application with Google Sheets for synchronization.
